{
  "_comment": "Source-quality registry for scripts/source_gate.py. The gate reads this file, so a host is added or demoted here — never in code. 'Primary' means the source of record for the claim (the regulator, the statute, the paper, the vendor's own changelog or pricing page). 'Blocked' means an aggregator, mirror, social post or tertiary wiki: it can repeat another outlet's reporting but it carries no retrievable provenance, so it can never be the citation that a claim rests on.",
